#message:22:0A3
{
[Style Right]
I see...a Truth Stomp Badge.[BR]
[Wait][Next]
You go west of the clearing of[BR]
Goomba Village to find a cave.[BR]
Enter deep into the cave to find[BR]
a pedestal with the Badge.[Wait][End]
}

#message:22:0A4
{
[Style Right]
I see...a Star Blessing Badge.[BR]
[Wait][Next]
When you leave Shiver City, head[BR]
south at the first road you see.[BR]
Continue onwards in the next room[BR]
as well.[BR]
[Wait][Next]
When you start walking south, drop[BR]
down to the right to find the Badge[BR]
inside a block on the cliff.[BR]
[Wait][End]
}

#message:22:0A5
{
[Style Right]
I see...a Jumpman Badge.[BR]
[Wait][Next]
You arrive at Pink Station in[BR]
Shy Guy's Toy Box and head east.[BR]
On your way there are some blocks[BR]
to climb up.[BR]
[Wait][Next]
Go behind the big block and reach for[BR]
the Badge Block.[Wait][End]
}

#message:22:0A6
{
[Style Right]
I see...a Hammerman Badge.[BR]
[Wait][Next]
Head west of the Kinoko Town[BR]
gate and make your way towards[BR]
the crossroads.[BR]
[Wait][Next]
Head north from the crossroad to[BR]
reach a dilapidated house.[BR]
To the side of the house is a block[BR]
with the Badge in it.[BR]
[Wait][End]
}